        "pid": 3989,
        "process_peak_rss_bytes": 351551488,
        "weights_sha256": "03f41729b69807deec2d3bb7dc7d45f5c0285d781fd598c4c4a848079cf1a0d9"
      },
      "file": "/Users/vas/Documents/macwispr/bench/results/redux_mlx/corpus-v2/say-fr.wav",
      "runtime": "redux-mlx",
      "seconds": 0.25231707096099854,
      "text": "Bonjour, je voudrais réserver une table pour deux personnes ce soir."
    },
    {
      "app_peak_rss_bytes": 84492288,
      "backend_memory": {
        "active_gpu_bytes": 220515778,
        "backend": "redux-mlx",
        "cache_gpu_bytes": 121814195,
        "peak_gpu_bytes": 260568493,
        "pid": 3989,
        "process_peak_rss_bytes": 352927744,
        "weights_sha256": "03f41729b69807deec2d3bb7dc7d45f5c0285d781fd598c4c4a848079cf1a0d9"
      },
      "file": "/Users/vas/Documents/macwispr/bench/results/redux_mlx/corpus-v2/say-de.wav",
      "runtime": "redux-mlx",
      "seconds": 0.2704000473022461,
      "text": "Guten Morgen, ich möchte einen Termin für nächste Woche vereinbaren."
    },
    {
      "app_peak_rss_bytes": 84492288,
      "backend_memory": {
        "active_gpu_bytes": 220515778,
        "backend": "redux-mlx",
        "cache_gpu_bytes": 147782835,
        "peak_gpu_bytes": 260568493,
        "pid": 3989,
        "process_peak_rss_bytes": 353173504,
        "weights_sha256": "03f41729b69807deec2d3bb7dc7d45f5c0285d781fd598c4c4a848079cf1a0d9"
      },
      "file": "/Users/vas/Documents/macwispr/bench/results/redux_mlx/corpus-v2/say-es.wav",
      "runtime": "redux-mlx",
      "seconds": 0.23910796642303467,
      "text": "Hola, necesito cambiar la fecha de mi vuelo en Madrid."
    },
    {
      "app_peak_rss_bytes": 84492288,
      "backend_memory": {
        "active_gpu_bytes": 220515778,
        "backend": "redux-mlx",
        "cache_gpu_bytes": 185957557,
        "peak_gpu_bytes": 260568493,
        "pid": 3989,
        "process_peak_rss_bytes": 353828864,
        "weights_sha256": "03f41729b69807deec2d3bb7dc7d45f5c0285d781fd598c4c4a848079cf1a0d9"
      },
      "file": "/Users/vas/Documents/macwispr/bench/results/redux_mlx/corpus-v2/say-it.wav",
      "runtime": "redux-mlx",
      "seconds": 0.2253410816192627,
      "text": "Buongiorno, vorrei prenotare una camera per tre notti."
    },
    {
      "app_peak_rss_bytes": 84672512,
      "backend_memory": {
        "active_gpu_bytes": 220515778,
        "backend": "redux-mlx",
        "cache_gpu_bytes": 195787957,
        "peak_gpu_bytes": 260568493,
        "pid": 3989,
        "process_peak_rss_bytes": 354058240,
        "weights_sha256": "03f41729b69807deec2d3bb7dc7d45f5c0285d781fd598c4c4a848079cf1a0d9"
      },
      "file": "/Users/vas/Documents/macwispr/bench/results/redux_mlx/corpus-v2/say-pt.wav",
      "runtime": "redux-mlx",
      "seconds": 0.2944720983505249,
      "text": "Bom dia, gostaria de agendar uma reunião para quinta-feira."
    },
    {
      "app_peak_rss_bytes": 85770240,
      "backend_memory": {
        "active_gpu_bytes": 220515778,
        "backend": "redux-mlx",
        "cache_gpu_bytes": 267484341,
        "peak_gpu_bytes": 289558664,
        "pid": 3989,
        "process_peak_rss_bytes": 357040128,
        "weights_sha256": "03f41729b69807deec2d3bb7dc7d45f5c0285d781fd598c4c4a848079cf1a0d9"
      },
      "file": "/Users/vas/Documents/macwispr/bench/results/redux_mlx/corpus-v2/ls-1089-134686-0000.wav",
      "runtime": "redux-mlx",
      "seconds": 0.44265997409820557,
      "text": "He hoped there would be stew for dinner, turnips and carrots and bruised potatoes, and fat mutton pieces to be ladled out in thick, peppered, flour fattened sauce"
    },
    {
      "app_peak_rss_bytes": 85770240,
      "backend_memory": {
        "active_gpu_bytes": 220515778,
        "backend": "redux-mlx",
        "cache_gpu_bytes": 272858293,
        "peak_gpu_bytes": 289558664,
        "pid": 3989,
        "process_peak_rss_bytes": 357236736,
        "weights_sha256": "03f41729b69807deec2d3bb7dc7d45f5c0285d781fd598c4c4a848079cf1a0d9"
      },
      "file": "/Users/vas/Documents/macwispr/bench/results/redux_mlx/corpus-v2/ls-1089-134686-0001.wav",
      "runtime": "redux-mlx",
      "seconds": 0.30607402324676514,
      "text": "Stuff it into you his belly counselled him."
    },
    {
      "app_peak_rss_bytes": 86638592,
      "backend_memory": {
        "active_gpu_bytes": 220515778,
        "backend": "redux-mlx",
        "cache_gpu_bytes": 315636917,
        "peak_gpu_bytes": 289558664,
        "pid": 3989,
        "process_peak_rss_bytes": 357711872,
        "weights_sha256": "03f41729b69807deec2d3bb7dc7d45f5c0285d781fd598c4c4a848079cf1a0d9"
      },
      "file": "/Users/vas/Documents/macwispr/bench/results/redux_mlx/corpus-v2/ls-1089-134686-0002.wav",
      "runtime": "redux-mlx",
      "seconds": 0.4318859577178955,
      "text": "After early nightfall the yellow lamps would light up here and there the squalid quarter of the brothels."
    },
    {
      "app_peak_rss_bytes": 86638592,
      "backend_memory": {
        "active_gpu_bytes": 220515778,
        "backend": "redux-mlx",
        "cache_gpu_bytes": 320502965,
        "peak_gpu_bytes": 289558664,
        "pid": 3989,
        "process_peak_rss_bytes": 357859328,
        "weights_sha256": "03f41729b69807deec2d3bb7dc7d45f5c0285d781fd598c4c4a848079cf1a0d9"
      },
      "file": "/Users/vas/Documents/macwispr/bench/results/redux_mlx/corpus-v2/ls-1089-134686-0003.wav",
      "runtime": "redux-mlx",
      "seconds": 0.2822599411010742,
      "text": "Hello, Bertie. Any good in your mind?"
    },
    {
      "app_peak_rss_bytes": 86638592,
      "backend_memory": {
        "active_gpu_bytes": 220515778,
        "backend": "redux-mlx",
        "cache_gpu_bytes": 329956533,
        "peak_gpu_bytes": 289558664,
        "pid": 3989,
        "process_peak_rss_bytes": 358154240,
        "weights_sha256": "03f41729b69807deec2d3bb7dc7d45f5c0285d781fd598c4c4a848079cf1a0d9"
      },
      "file": "/Users/vas/Documents/macwispr/bench/results/redux_mlx/corpus-v2/ls-1089-134686-0004.wav",
      "runtime": "redux-mlx",
      "seconds": 0.3305480480194092,
      "text": "Number ten Fresh Nelly is waiting on you. Good night, husband,"
    },
    {
      "app_peak_rss_bytes": 86966272,
      "backend_memory": {
        "active_gpu_bytes": 220515778,
        "backend": "redux-mlx",
        "cache_gpu_bytes": 398344797,
        "peak_gpu_bytes": 291239943,
        "pid": 3989,
        "process_peak_rss_bytes": 368705536,
        "weights_sha256": "03f41729b69807deec2d3bb7dc7d45f5c0285d781fd598c4c4a848079cf1a0d9"
      },
      "file": "/Users/vas/Documents/macwispr/bench/results/redux_mlx/corpus-v2/ls-1089-134686-0005.wav",
      "runtime": "redux-mlx",
      "seconds": 0.4025580883026123,
      "text": "The music came nearer, and he recalled the words the words of Shelley's fragment upon the moon, wandering companionless, pale for weariness."
    },
    {
      "app_peak_rss_bytes": 87097344,
      "backend_memory": {
        "active_gpu_bytes": 220515778,
        "backend": "redux-mlx",
        "cache_gpu_bytes": 437273181,
        "peak_gpu_bytes": 291239943,
        "pid": 3989,
        "process_peak_rss_bytes": 369295360,
        "weights_sha256": "03f41729b69807deec2d3bb7dc7d45f5c0285d781fd598c4c4a848079cf1a0d9"
      },
      "file": "/Users/vas/Documents/macwispr/bench/results/redux_mlx/corpus-v2/ls-1089-134686-0006.wav",
      "runtime": "redux-mlx",
      "seconds": 0.5809379816055298,
      "text": "The dull light fell more faintly upon the page, whereon another equation began to unfold itself slowly and to spread abroad its widening tail."
    },
    {
      "app_peak_rss_bytes": 87113728,
      "backend_memory": {
        "active_gpu_bytes": 220515778,
        "backend": "redux-mlx",
        "cache_gpu_bytes": 461062749,
        "peak_gpu_bytes": 291239943,
        "pid": 3989,
        "process_peak_rss_bytes": 369541120,
        "weights_sha256": "03f41729b69807deec2d3bb7dc7d45f5c0285d781fd598c4c4a848079cf1a0d9"
      },
      "file": "/Users/vas/Documents/macwispr/bench/results/redux_mlx/corpus-v2/ls-1089-134686-0007.wav",
      "runtime": "redux-mlx",
      "seconds": 0.17154300212860107,
      "text": "A cold, lucid indifference reigned in his soul."
    },
    {
      "app_peak_rss_bytes": 87441408,
      "backend_memory": {
        "active_gpu_bytes": 220515778,
        "backend": "redux-mlx",
        "cache_gpu_bytes": 498844253,
        "peak_gpu_bytes": 291239943,
        "pid": 3989,
        "process_peak_rss_bytes": 370622464,
        "weights_sha256": "03f41729b69807deec2d3bb7dc7d45f5c0285d781fd598c4c4a848079cf1a0d9"
      },
      "file": "/Users/vas/Documents/macwispr/bench/results/redux_mlx/corpus-v2/ls-1089-134686-0008.wav",
      "runtime": "redux-mlx",
      "seconds": 0.48684704303741455,
      "text": "The chaos in which his ardour extinguished itself was a cold, indifferent knowledge of himself,"
    },
    {
      "app_peak_rss_bytes": 87932928,
      "backend_memory": {
        "active_gpu_bytes": 220515778,
        "backend": "redux-mlx",
        "cache_gpu_bytes": 550732381,
        "peak_gpu_bytes": 291393672,
        "pid": 3989,
        "process_peak_rss_bytes": 371195904,
        "weights_sha256": "03f41729b69807deec2d3bb7dc7d45f5c0285d781fd598c4c4a848079cf1a0d9"
      },
      "file": "/Users/vas/Documents/macwispr/bench/results/redux_mlx/corpus-v2/ls-1089-134686-0009.wav",
      "runtime": "redux-mlx",
      "seconds": 0.4255720376968384,
      "text": "At most, by an alms given to a beggar whose blessing he fled from, he might hope wearily to win for himself some measure of actual grace."
    },
    {
      "app_peak_rss_bytes": 87932928,
      "backend_memory": {
        "active_gpu_bytes": 220515778,
        "backend": "redux-mlx",
        "cache_gpu_bytes": 579043933,
        "peak_gpu_bytes": 291393672,
        "pid": 3989,
        "process_peak_rss_bytes": 371441664,
        "weights_sha256": "03f41729b69807deec2d3bb7dc7d45f5c0285d781fd598c4c4a848079cf1a0d9"
      },
      "file": "/Users/vas/Documents/macwispr/bench/results/redux_mlx/corpus-v2/ls-1089-134686-0010.wav",
      "runtime": "redux-mlx",
      "seconds": 0.31245899200439453,
      "text": "Well now, Ennis, I declare you have a head, and so has my stick,"
    },
    {
      "app_peak_rss_bytes": 88211456,
